### H1a — créer la version 1 d'un prompt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v2/prompts
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"spike-prompt","type":"text","prompt":"---\nversion: 1\n---\n# SYSTEM\nBonjour.","labels":["v1","production"],"config":{"socloverVersion":1},"commitMessage":"spike"}

### H1b — créer la version 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v2/prompts
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"spike-prompt","type":"text","prompt":"---\nversion: 2\n---\n# SYSTEM\nBonsoir.","labels":["v2"],"config":{"socloverVersion":2},"commitMessage":"spike"}

### H1c — lister : attendu data[0].versions = [1, 2]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v2/prompts?name=spike-prompt
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}

### H1d — lire par version : attendu prompt = contenu v1 (chaîne), version = 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v2/prompts/spike-prompt?version=1
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}

### H1e — lire par label : attendu version = 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v2/prompts/spike-prompt?label=production
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}

### H2a — créer un dataset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v2/datasets
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"spike-dataset","description":"spike","metadata":{"benchHash":"abc123"}}

> {% client.global.set("datasetId", response.body.id); %}

### H2b — item à id fourni (à envoyer DEUX fois) : attendu id = "dev-001-Top", un seul item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/dataset-items
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"datasetName":"spike-dataset","id":"dev-001-Top","input":{"words":["Paradis","Terrasse"]},"expectedOutput":{"referenceWords":["Paradis","Terrasse"]},"metadata":{"benchHash":"abc123"}}

### H2c — relire le dataset : attendu metadata.benchHash = abc123
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v2/datasets/spike-dataset
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}

### H3 — experiment OTLP daté du 2026-07-28 (à envoyer DEUX fois : attendu aucun doublon)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/otel/v1/traces
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}
x-langfuse-ingestion-version: 4
Content-Type: application/json

{"resourceSpans":[{"resource":{"attributes":[{"key":"service.name","value":{"stringValue":"soclover-eval"}}]},"scopeSpans":[{"scope":{"name":"soclover-eval.spike"},"spans":[
 {"traceId":"0af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c","spanId":"b7ad6b7169203331","name":"experiment-item","kind":1,"startTimeUnixNano":"1785196800000000000","endTimeUnixNano":"1785196801200000000","attributes":[
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.id","value":{"stringValue":"spike-experiment"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.name","value":{"stringValue":"spike-experiment"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.dataset.id","value":{"stringValue":"{{datasetId}}"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.item.id","value":{"stringValue":"dev-001-Top"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.item.root_observation_id","value":{"stringValue":"b7ad6b7169203331"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.item.expected_output","value":{"stringValue":"{\"referenceWords\":[\"Paradis\",\"Terrasse\"]}"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.observation.input","value":{"stringValue":"{\"words\":[\"Paradis\",\"Terrasse\"]}"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.observation.output","value":{"stringValue":"Jardin"}}]},
 {"traceId":"0af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c","spanId":"c1b2c3d4e5f60718","parentSpanId":"b7ad6b7169203331","name":"decode-clue #0","kind":1,"startTimeUnixNano":"1785196800100000000","endTimeUnixNano":"1785196801100000000","attributes":[
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.id","value":{"stringValue":"spike-experiment"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.name","value":{"stringValue":"spike-experiment"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.dataset.id","value":{"stringValue":"{{datasetId}}"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.item.id","value":{"stringValue":"dev-001-Top"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.experiment.item.root_observation_id","value":{"stringValue":"b7ad6b7169203331"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.observation.type","value":{"stringValue":"generation"}},
  {"key":"gen_ai.request.model","value":{"stringValue":"qwen/qwen3-8b"}},
  {"key":"langfuse.observation.output","value":{"stringValue":"Paradis + Terrasse"}}]}
]}]}]}

### H4a — score sur l'observation de décodage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/scores
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"spike-score-r","traceId":"0af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c","observationId":"c1b2c3d4e5f60718","name":"r","value":1,"dataType":"NUMERIC"}

### H4b — retrouver le dataset run de l'experiment : attendu un id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/datasets/spike-dataset/runs/spike-experiment
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}

> {% client.global.set("datasetRunId", response.body.id); %}

### H4c — score de run
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/scores
Authorization: Basic {{publicKey}} {{secretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"spike-score-run","datasetRunId":"{{datasetRunId}}","name":"recovery","value":0.37,"dataType":"NUMERIC","comment":"n = 154"}
